<title>SINGAPORE: YHS 1996 net profit up 10.1 pct.</title>
<headline>YHS 1996 net profit up 10.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31,1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     9.99  vs   9.08</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     2.00  vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		  7.03  vs   6.39</p>
<p>    Turnover			     209.74  vs 207.01</p>
<p>    Interest and other income	  4.6   vs   4.4</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     3.7   vs   3.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation   12.2   vs  10.7</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	    9.1   vs   7.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			12.8   vs  17.1</p>
<p>    Tax					2.8   vs   6.0</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		     -    vs   2.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (gain)	     0.3   vs   2.3</p>
<p>Note - Yeo Hiap Seng Ltd makes soft drinks. The company also has property interests. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
